    "natal-aspect:sun:moon:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:moon:conjunction",
      "text": "Personal aims and habitual responses become closely bound together, concentrating attention on the concerns of the occupied sign and house. This can produce a strongly marked outlook, but also stubbornness or difficulty adapting to other interests. The combination is not automatically harmonious: its expression depends on the wider chart.",
