      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:moon:sextile",
      "text": "Personal aims and established habits are broadly compatible, so later interests can develop without a sharp break from early influences. The traditional reading emphasizes agreement between private life and outward activity, with relatively little inner division. This is a general tendency toward concord, not a guarantee that every relationship or ambition will proceed easily.",
