      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:moon:square",
      "text": "Personal aims and familiar patterns may pull in different directions, producing a division between the life pursued outwardly and the interests felt privately. Domestic circumstances and professional activity may also conflict. The interpretation concerns a lack of coordination rather than a simple weakness of character; considerable intelligence and mental energy can still be present.",
