    "natal-aspect:sun:mercury:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:mercury:conjunction",
      "text": "Thinking is closely involved with personal feelings and purposes, giving opinions a firm, self-assured character. The mind may be practical and vigorous while finding it difficult to remain impartial or receptive to advice. Intellectual ability is not necessarily diminished. Adaptability and a willingness to reconsider an established view are important qualifications to this reading.",
      "group": "sun-mercury-conjunction",
