          "qualification": "Passage-checked against transcription; edition and printed pagination verification pending."
        }
      ]
    },
    "natal-aspect:sun:mars:sextile": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:mars:sextile",
      "text": "Energy is available for decisive action, practical effort and the pursuit of a clear purpose. Its expression need not be physical or combative: intellectual work, forceful argument and sustained thought also belong to this reading. The broader chart determines the direction of the activity, and favourable contact does not remove every tendency toward strain or risk.",
      "group": "sun-mars-sextile",
