    "natal-aspect:sun:mars:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:mars:square",
      "text": "Strong energy may be expressed hastily, with a tendency to take risks, overwork or turn disagreement into a contest. Generous intentions can coexist with a combative manner or a conviction that others need reforming. The pattern can operate through argument and thought as well as action; it does not by itself establish cruelty or bad intentions.",
