    },
    "natal-aspect:sun:jupiter:sextile": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:jupiter:sextile",
      "text": "Intellectual interests, goodwill and relatively modest wants are emphasized more than a drive for material display. The traditional account describes enjoyment of a quiet life and pleasures of the mind, with achievement often taking an intellectual form. This should not be reduced to a promise of riches: personal ambition may be limited even where ability is considerable.",
