    "natal-aspect:sun:jupiter:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:jupiter:square",
      "text": "Optimism and mental ability may be accompanied by restlessness, imprudence or a dislike of routine. Enthusiasm can carry expectations beyond what circumstances support, encouraging hazardous ventures or attractive shortcuts. The traditional account allows considerable intelligence and an appealing youthful spirit alongside these difficulties, so the interpretation should address judgment and excess rather than assume a lack of ability.",
