    "natal-aspect:sun:saturn:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:saturn:conjunction",
      "text": "Personal vigour and restraint are brought into a close, sometimes difficult relationship. In one expression, effort becomes directed and disciplined, supporting achievements earned through work; in another, obligation dominates private satisfaction or activity becomes secluded. The balance matters: the conjunction should not be described as either inevitable failure or an automatic gift of responsibility.",
      "group": "sun-saturn-conjunction",
      "status": "passage-checked-transcription-edition-pending",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "C. E. O. Carter, The Astrological Aspects",
