    "natal-aspect:sun:saturn:sextile": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:saturn:sextile",
      "text": "Expression of personal purpose is shaped by circumstance, responsibility and the need for patient effort. Constructive work, careful thought and deliberate action are emphasized, but a sense of restriction may remain even when the contact is favourable. The traditional reading allows achievement through persistence while warning that obligations can still be heavy or difficult to carry.",
      "group": "sun-saturn-sextile",
