    "natal-aspect:sun:saturn:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:saturn:square",
      "text": "Ambition or the wish for self-expression may encounter delays, obstacles or circumstances that offer less reward than the effort expended. This does not rule out substantial achievement: the traditional account includes capable people who succeed through sustained work. The difficulty lies in securing satisfactory expression and recognition, rather than in an inevitable absence of ability or accomplishment.",
