      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:uranus:sextile",
      "text": "Independent purpose and a clearly defined outlook can support leadership and personal influence. The traditional account emphasizes a capacity to hold to an aim and attract others through personality or ability, although tact may be imperfect. This is more specific than a general love of novelty: steadiness of purpose is part of the favourable reading.",
