    "natal-aspect:sun:neptune:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:sun:neptune:conjunction",
      "text": "Sensitivity and strong enthusiasm may draw attention toward music, other arts or subjects removed from ordinary practical concerns. Interest can become a lasting devotion rather than a passing attraction. The traditional account does not exclude practical ability, but dedication to these pursuits may compete with material aims; the conjunction should not be equated automatically with worldly success or incapacity.",
