      "text": "Sympathy, enthusiasm and the desire for something exceptional may make judgment susceptible to appealing promises or misleading impressions. Good intentions can coexist with confusion about motives, impractical expectations or a wish to bypass necessary details. The traditional reading therefore concerns vulnerability to deception and emotional excess, rather than a simple absence of kindness or worthwhile ideals.",
