    "natal-aspect:moon:mercury:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:mercury:conjunction",
      "text": "An active imagination and a searching mind bring feeling and thought into close contact. Understanding may be quick and penetrating, with considerable intellectual activity, but sensitivity can make impressions unusually personal. This is a combination of mental liveliness and receptiveness; occasional eccentricity or changeability should not be mistaken for an absence of intelligence.",
