      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:mercury:sextile",
      "text": "Practical understanding and reasoning tend to support each other. Thoughts are usually expressed plainly, with an interest in making information useful and comprehensible. Writing, teaching and ordinary exchanges of ideas are natural fields for this combination. A considerate disposition can soften an otherwise factual manner, while judgment is generally measured rather than showy.",
      "group": "moon-mercury-sextile",
