      "text": "Mental activity can be sharp and independent, while feelings make expression more reactive or difficult to organize. A quickly spoken criticism may create misunderstandings, especially where loyalties are involved. The same sensitivity can support vigorous advocacy for friends or vulnerable people. These contacts describe tension in communication, rather than an absence of intelligence or sympathy.",
