    "natal-aspect:moon:venus:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:venus:conjunction",
      "text": "Affection and an appreciation of beauty strongly colour the temperament. Artistic interests, agreeable surroundings and a composed manner may be important, with a marked wish to make life pleasant. The combination can support sociability and careful perspective, but its attractive qualities should not be turned into a promise that family life or relationships will always be easy.",
