      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:venus:sextile",
      "text": "A sense of proportion helps feelings and judgments work together. Kindness, sociability and artistic appreciation may accompany an ability to respond appropriately to people and circumstances. The traditional emphasis includes composure and an optimistic outlook, rather than sentiment alone. These qualities can favour harmonious relationships, while their expression still depends on the surrounding chart.",
