      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:venus:square",
      "text": "Affection can be sincere and active even when close relationships bring disappointment or conflicting needs. Attachment may become idealized, making it difficult to judge a partner's influence clearly. The difficulty can concern associations more widely, rather than marriage alone. Sociability and personal appeal remain possible; the contact should not be read as an inability to love.",
