    "natal-aspect:moon:mars:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:mars:conjunction",
      "text": "Emotional responses and active effort are strongly joined, producing enterprise, courage and a readiness to act. The energy may be outgoing and adventurous, or concentrated in penetrating thought. Kind intentions can coexist with impatience, resentment or excessive risk. The wider chart helps distinguish constructive independence from an impulse to fight every obstacle encountered.",
