      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:mars:sextile",
      "text": "Feeling can supply practical courage and a direct response to circumstances. This may appear as enterprise and physical activity, or as sustained, penetrating thought rather than outward combativeness. Warm intentions and plain speaking often accompany the vigour. The combination favours engagement with life, without necessarily implying a liking for discipline or a military temperament.",
