    "natal-aspect:moon:jupiter:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:jupiter:conjunction",
      "text": "Warmth, protectiveness and a generous response to others are emphasized, together with considerable emotional energy. Practical ability may accompany the goodwill, although restlessness can encourage frequent changes of interest or circumstance. Confidence sometimes becomes an inflated sense of personal importance. The combination resembles the easier contacts, with greater intensity rather than an entirely different meaning.",
      "group": "moon-jupiter-conjunction",
      "status": "passage-checked-transcription-edition-pending",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "C. E. O. Carter, The Astrological Aspects",
