    "natal-aspect:moon:jupiter:sextile": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:jupiter:sextile",
      "text": "A friendly, sympathetic disposition is joined by optimism and an ability to enjoy ordinary life. Imagination may find expression in literature, philosophy or an interest in distant places, without requiring constant physical travel. Practical shrewdness can accompany generosity. The traditional reading concerns goodwill and opportunity more than an unconditional promise of personal wealth.",
