    "natal-aspect:moon:jupiter:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:jupiter:square",
      "text": "Kindliness and generosity remain possible, but confidence may outrun practical judgment. Restlessness, inconsistent attitudes to money or a willingness to let difficulties drift can interfere with otherwise useful abilities. Some expressions are energetic and argumentative, while others favour comfort and avoidance of effort. The surrounding chart determines how strongly these tendencies affect achievement and stability.",
      "group": "moon-jupiter-square",
