    },
    "natal-aspect:moon:saturn:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:saturn:square",
      "text": "Responsibilities may feel burdensome, while uncertainty or fear makes it harder to organize effort confidently. Emotional reserve can become dissatisfaction, and attention to immediate difficulties may obscure a larger purpose. The account also allows patience and endurance to develop under pressure. This is a reading of constraint and frustration, without a fixed judgment about ability or eventual success.",
      "group": "moon-saturn-square",
