    "natal-aspect:moon:uranus:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:uranus:conjunction",
      "text": "A strong need for an individual course can make routine and outside interference difficult to accept. Feelings may be intense, with unusual interests and determined attachments that are not easily explained to others. Independence can be valuable, but judgment needs separate consideration. The force of a conviction alone does not establish that the chosen direction is wise.",
