      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:uranus:sextile",
      "text": "Conviction and determination may be unusually firm, particularly around an ideal or a sense of obligation. Unconventional interests can coexist with loyal persistence and assistance from friends. These are not necessarily flexible contacts: a settled belief may resist discussion. Their usefulness depends on the judgment and practical understanding supplied by the rest of the chart.",
