    "natal-aspect:moon:neptune:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:neptune:conjunction",
      "text": "Sensitivity and sympathy can be strong, with a wish to protect others or retreat from harsh surroundings. At the same time, emotional satisfaction may remain elusive, producing changing moods or inconsistent responses. The combination can be warmhearted without being steady. Its meaning is better understood through the whole chart than through an assumption of spiritual gifts.",
