      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:neptune:sextile",
      "text": "Imagination enlarges emotional interests and may encourage aspirations beyond ordinary experience. There can be a wish to accomplish something exceptional, or to give familiar activities a more ambitious form. Helpful circumstances do not necessarily remove dissatisfaction. An important qualification is the difficulty of accepting practical limits when the imagined possibilities continue to expand.",
