    "natal-aspect:moon:neptune:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:moon:neptune:square",
      "text": "High expectations can make ordinary imperfections difficult to accept, in yourself or in close relationships. Imagination may enrich experience but can also encourage avoidance, uncertainty or disappointment when hopes are treated as facts. A romantic or creative outlet may give these feelings expression. The contact does not justify a fixed accusation of dishonesty or a prediction about a partner.",
