    "natal-aspect:mercury:venus:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:mercury:venus:conjunction",
      "text": "Thought and expression are closely joined to sociability and an appreciation of pleasing form. Conversation, writing or artistic work may gain charm and an agreeable manner, even where intellectual originality is not especially marked. The conjunction gives this tendency greater emphasis than the sextile. Its promise concerns how ideas are expressed, rather than automatic depth or genius.",
