      "id": "natal-aspect:mercury:venus:sextile",
      "text": "An agreeable style can help ideas reach other people through conversation, writing or artistic interests. Friendliness, good spirits and a liking for pleasant company are emphasized, though the contact does not in itself supply exceptional intellectual power. Its effect is relatively modest and works within the wider chart, supporting expression rather than determining the whole temperament.",
