    "natal-aspect:mercury:mars:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:mercury:mars:conjunction",
      "text": "Thinking and speech can be vigorous, direct and ready for controversy. The mind may enjoy argument, satire or writing that requires force and courage. Sincerity can be a strength, while excessive combativeness or mental overwork can diminish its usefulness. The combination supplies energy more reliably than tact, and needs the wider chart to show its direction.",
      "group": "mercury-mars-conjunction",
      "status": "passage-checked-transcription-edition-pending",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "C. E. O. Carter, The Astrological Aspects",
          "url": "https://pdfcoffee.com/the-astrological-aspects-by-charles-carter-pdf-free.html",
