      "text": "An alert, practical mind can respond quickly and identify weaknesses in an argument. Discussion, debate and decisive intellectual work may be congenial, with courage to defend a position. The tone is often direct rather than sentimental. Even these easier contacts can enjoy contest or risk, so their vigour should not automatically be equated with calm judgment.",
