      "id": "natal-aspect:venus:mars:trine",
      "text": "Warm feelings can be expressed generously and directly, with a strong wish for affectionate exchange. Independence remains important, so emotional warmth should not be confused with passivity or dependence. The contact may support enjoyable family relationships and soften a combative manner. Its promise depends on the planets' wider condition, rather than guaranteeing an uncomplicated romantic life.",
