      "text": "An expansive social or artistic quality may appear through polished expression, enthusiasm or a wish to give pleasure. The conjunction can also encourage emotional excess and an appetite for admiration or enjoyment. Its character varies considerably with the sign and the wider chart. Popularity is possible, but neither laziness nor effortless personal happiness should be assumed.",
