    "natal-aspect:venus:saturn:sextile": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:venus:saturn:sextile",
      "text": "Affection tends to be concentrated and serious, with personal pleasure sometimes set aside for duty or an important ideal. These easier aspects do not remove the underlying contrast between enjoyment and restraint. Their constructive expression can be devoted and willingly self-denying. The emphasis is on the quality of commitment, rather than uncomplicated comfort or emotional lightness.",
      "group": "venus-saturn-sextile",
