    "natal-aspect:venus:saturn:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:venus:saturn:square",
      "text": "Duty, ambition or family responsibility may compete with the wish for affection and enjoyment. Loyalty can be deep, yet fear of disappointment or a tendency to preserve grievances may make warmth difficult to express. The account allows genuine devotion alongside constraint. It should not be turned into a certainty of loneliness, separation or an unhappy marriage.",
