    "natal-aspect:venus:uranus:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:venus:uranus:conjunction",
      "text": "A strong longing for beauty, peace or an ideal relationship can create considerable emotional intensity. Original artistic expression is possible, while impulsiveness or self-will may make ordinary compromises difficult. Steadiness must be assessed elsewhere in the chart. The conjunction describes a powerful demand for personal expression, rather than a guarantee of genius or a particular relationship outcome.",
