    "natal-aspect:venus:uranus:sextile": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:venus:uranus:sextile",
      "text": "Unusual tastes and a romantic imagination may find expression in music, literature, performance or a distinctive social manner. The effect can be modest, amounting to an appreciation of art rather than exceptional talent. Independence and emotional responsiveness are both important. Finding a fitting expression for these interests matters more than assuming that every relationship must be unconventional.",
      "group": "venus-uranus-sextile",
