    "natal-aspect:venus:uranus:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:venus:uranus:square",
      "text": "Affection may be accompanied by a strong insistence on personal freedom, making compromise difficult when feelings and expectations become fixed. A kind disposition can coexist with touchiness or resistance to discussing motives. The reading concerns tension in cooperation and attachment. It does not establish promiscuity, and unusual preferences alone should not be treated as evidence of poor character.",
