    "natal-aspect:venus:neptune:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:venus:neptune:conjunction",
      "text": "Tenderness and sympathy may be unusually responsive, especially toward suffering or the needs of animals. Artistic or spiritual interests can accompany a delicate emotional temperament. Affections may be difficult to express fully, and withdrawal can seem more congenial than competition. The conjunction does not by itself promise exceptional artistic achievement or the practical strength to realize every ideal.",
