      "id": "natal-aspect:venus:neptune:sextile",
      "text": "A refined appreciation of beauty may support music, art or a receptive and sympathetic manner. The effect is often subtle, and taste does not necessarily become exceptional creative ability. Dreaminess or dependence on favourable circumstances can limit practical achievement. The interpretation emphasizes sensitivity and aesthetic response, with sustained work requiring other support in the chart.",
