    "natal-aspect:venus:neptune:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:venus:neptune:square",
      "text": "A high ideal of affection or beauty may create persistent dissatisfaction with ordinary experience. Artistic effort can be strong, yet sensitivity may magnify small differences or make clear decisions difficult. Confused expectations can also complicate relationships and money matters. Direct dealings and careful discrimination fit this account better than assuming either inevitable deception or a lack of creative ability.",
