    "natal-aspect:mars:jupiter:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:mars:jupiter:conjunction",
      "text": "Energy and conviction can be wholehearted, with strong likes, dislikes and a readiness for ambitious undertakings. The temperament may be frank, humorous or adventurous, but can also become contentious or dissatisfied. Resourcefulness is possible when facing opposition. The conjunction strengthens enterprise without guaranteeing that every aim is wise or that material comfort will satisfy the appetite for more.",
