    "natal-aspect:mars:jupiter:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:mars:jupiter:square",
      "text": "Enthusiasm may exceed proportion, producing extreme commitments, waste or dissatisfaction with ordinary limits. This can take an austere form as readily as an indulgent one. Considerable work is possible, though effort may depend too much on mood or excitement. The central issue is moderation and sound judgment, rather than a simple prediction of failure or lack of opportunity.",
