      "id": "natal-aspect:mars:saturn:sextile",
      "text": "Energy can be disciplined by patience, while caution gains courage and a greater willingness to act. Endurance, orderly effort and practical ability are central strengths, especially under demanding conditions. The easier aspects still do not remove every possibility of hardship. Their constructive expression depends on the planets being supported elsewhere in the chart as well.",
      "group": "mars-saturn-sextile",
