    "natal-aspect:mars:saturn:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:mars:saturn:square",
      "text": "Initiative may alternate with inhibition, creating bursts of effort followed by loss of interest or impatience with delay. Sternness can be directed outward or become personal austerity and self-discipline. The account explicitly allows kind dispositions and eventual success. The difficulty lies in coordinating energy and persistence, rather than assuming that the contact necessarily makes someone cruel.",
