    "natal-aspect:mars:uranus:trine": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:mars:uranus:trine",
      "text": "Decisiveness and a strong will can support demanding work and the ability to persist under difficult conditions. Courage is a central quality, but its usefulness depends on judgment and purpose. These easier contacts should not be treated as automatically restful or gentle. Other tensions in the chart can make even a productive combination more wearing or difficult to manage.",
      "group": "mars-uranus-sextile",
