    "natal-aspect:mars:neptune:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:mars:neptune:conjunction",
      "text": "Romance, colour and imaginative experience may be sought with considerable intensity. Art, music, ritual or a desire to explore beneath appearances can attract strong effort, while ambitions may exceed what circumstances can support. Promising beginnings can become complicated or disappointing. The conjunction calls for a separate assessment of practical judgment rather than equating enthusiasm with achievement.",
