    "natal-aspect:mars:neptune:sextile": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:mars:neptune:sextile",
      "text": "Strong feelings may be directed into useful assistance, self-restraint and a wish to deal honestly with others. Sympathy can coexist with an ability to notice insincerity, giving the combination a practical side. Artistic interests are possible but are not its only expression. The emphasis is on controlled action and helpfulness rather than fantasy alone.",
      "group": "mars-neptune-sextile",
