    "natal-aspect:mars:neptune:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:mars:neptune:square",
      "text": "Imagination can make ordinary life seem too limited, encouraging romantic ambitions or an intense commitment to creative pursuits. Disappointment may arise when aspiration exceeds ability or when sympathy outruns discrimination. The account gives art and performance a legitimate expression for this force. It explicitly resists reducing the contact to a fixed accusation of vice or misconduct.",
