          "qualification": "Passage-checked against transcription; edition and printed pagination verification pending."
        }
      ]
    },
    "natal-aspect:jupiter:saturn:sextile": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:jupiter:saturn:sextile",
      "text": "Long-range aims can gain practical form through patience, organization and a willingness to learn from experience. Optimism is tempered by responsibility, making sustained constructive work possible. The contact does not operate independently of the rest of the chart. Its strongest promise is the coordination of growth and consolidation, rather than a guarantee of material position.",
      "group": "jupiter-saturn-sextile",
