    "natal-aspect:jupiter:saturn:square": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:jupiter:saturn:square",
      "text": "Expansion and caution may fail to work together, producing dissatisfaction, delayed opportunities or uneven persistence. One expression reaches beyond what can be sustained; another becomes so restricted that initiative fades. Achievement remains possible, often with considerable effort. The relative strength of the planets matters, and the contact should not be read as a complete denial of success.",
