    "natal-aspect:jupiter:uranus:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:jupiter:uranus:conjunction",
      "text": "Independent beliefs and a wish to reform accepted arrangements may be strongly developed. Inventiveness can accompany argumentativeness or resentment of restriction, with little attraction to an established path merely because it is conventional. The combination can support leadership, but may also appear chiefly as restlessness. Its full expression requires consideration of more personal factors in the chart.",
