    "natal-aspect:jupiter:uranus:sextile": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:jupiter:uranus:sextile",
      "text": "Originality and conviction may support discovery, leadership or an active defence of individual freedom. There can be an ability to kindle enthusiasm in others without relying on sentiment alone. In a quieter chart the effect may be limited or indirect. This slow-planet contact needs support elsewhere before it can be read as an exceptional personal ability.",
      "group": "jupiter-uranus-sextile",
