      "text": "A searching, independent outlook may challenge accepted beliefs and seek unfamiliar experiences. Enthusiasm can arrive in bursts, while bluntness or an unwillingness to compromise complicates cooperation. Considerable ability is still possible. The difficulty is sustaining a useful course without making opposition to convention an end in itself, especially when confidence becomes resistant to correction.",
