    "natal-aspect:jupiter:neptune:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:jupiter:neptune:conjunction",
      "text": "Humane interests and idealistic beliefs may colour several areas of life, sometimes in a subtle way. Music, imaginative work or concern for animals and suffering can provide expression. The effect is not necessarily conventional in religion or philosophy. Because this is a shared slow-planet pattern, its personal strength depends on the rest of the chart.",
