    "natal-aspect:saturn:uranus:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:saturn:uranus:conjunction",
      "text": "Determination, originality and a strong will can be directed toward unusual aims or difficult, lasting problems. Broad intentions may coexist with a controlling method, making tact and patience important. The conjunction can support substantial ability without much desire to please convention. Its influence is shared widely and becomes more personal through prominent placement or other planetary contacts.",
