      "text": "A wish for freedom may conflict with an equally strong wish to control circumstances. Convictions and methods can become inconsistent, while frustration makes adjustment difficult. The same force may support strenuous work against obstacles, so ability is not excluded. Its personal importance depends especially on prominent placement and connections with other planets, rather than the aspect alone.",
