    "natal-aspect:saturn:neptune:conjunction": {
      "id": "natal-aspect:saturn:neptune:conjunction",
      "text": "Practical organization and idealistic aims can combine in unusual ability, especially where planning is followed by sustained execution. Alternatively, confidence in a special mission may overwhelm proportion and judgment. Material and idealistic priorities may alternate or require reconciliation. The surrounding chart helps show which tendency predominates and whether the conjunction has a strong personal expression.",
