      "id": "natal-aspect:saturn:neptune:sextile",
      "text": "Method, foresight and careful execution can give imaginative plans a workable form. There may be skill in organizing complicated matters and patiently disentangling uncertainty. Success is not automatic, and sustained effort can still be required. This is a reading of practical competence and conscientious work, rather than an assumption that a Neptune contact must be vague or ineffective.",
